 ],
 "literal": "In the town, gossip rising, in the street, making a loud noise, / ceaselessly tormenting, mother who has no virtue, / let her remain alone in her own house! / Eating gooseberries, so that her thorn-like teeth shine, / she desired to eat with him in the distant country, / on the slopes of the high mountain that rises to touch the sky, / like a plot where sugarcane is planted, / the water remaining in the footprints of the great male elephant.",
 "translation": "Let mother, who lacks all virtue and ceaselessly torments us while gossip rises in the town and the streets clamor, remain all by herself in her house! My friend, with her thorn-sharp teeth shining from eating gooseberries, has chosen to eat with him in that distant land, on the slopes of the high mountain rising to touch the sky, drinking the water that stands in the deep footprints of a great male elephant, which look like plots prepared for planting sugarcane.",
 "modern": "ஊரில் அலர் எழவும், தெருவில் ஆரவாரம் உண்டாகவும், எங்களை இடைவிடாது துன்புறுத்தும் அறமற்ற அன்னை தன் வீட்டிலேயே தனியாக இருக்கட்டும்! நெல்லிக்காயைத் தின்றதால் முள் போன்ற பற்கள் விளங்க, அவள் அவரோடு தொலைதூர நாட்டில், வானைத் தொடுமளவு உயர்ந்த மலைச் சாரலில், கரும்பு நடும் பாத்தியைப் போன்ற பெரிய ஆண் யானையின் காலடித் தடத்தில் தேங்கியுள்ள நீரை விரும்பி உண்பாளாக!",
 "explanation": "This poem is spoken by the heroine's friend (தோழி) after the heroine has eloped with her lover. The friend expresses her anger at the heroine's mother, who was unyielding and kept tormenting the heroine while the town gossiped. She wishes that the mother be left entirely alone in her house. In contrast, she describes how the heroine will happily survive in the harsh desert path with her lover. The image of the elephant's footprint holding water like a sugarcane plot shows that even in the dry, mountainous wasteland, the water they find will seem sweet and abundant to them because they are together. The 'thorn-like teeth shining from eating gooseberries' highlights the heroine's simple joy and resilience.",
